event: final
data: {"type":"final","sequence":0,"request_id":"7253b819-24dc-4a4a-ba92-0b631398904e","status":true,"message":"Chat turn processed successfully.","timestamp":"2026-08-14T08:20:01.207305+00:00","data":{"ai_message":"### Survey ready\n**“Are Workplaces Ready for New Parents?”** is ready as a 20-question survey draft. It is designed for expecting parents and parents of young children across remote, hybrid, and office-based workplaces.\n\n### Research strategy\nThis is an **Employee Engagement and Organizational Health** study examining how workplace policies, manager practices, team norms, workload, and benefits affect the employee experience for new and expecting parents. The findings will help determine which flexible-work policies, management practices, and family-support benefits employers should prioritize to reduce workplace friction and improve retention, wellbeing, and career visibility.\n\n### Survey structure\nRespondents will move through seven structured sections: **Overall Engagement**, **Role & Growth**, **Manager Relationship**, **Team & Collaboration**, **Culture & Values**, **Wellbeing & Workload**, and **Recognition & Fairness**. The survey uses the combined **PARENT_STATUS** screener to identify expecting parents, current parents, people who are not currently working, and respondents who do not fit either parent group while maintaining the exact 20-question budget.\n\n### Routing & logic\nSmart branching and screening logic have been built in. Respondents are routed based on their answers using **3 branching rules and screening gates**, helping ensure that relevant questions are shown to eligible participants without adding unnecessary respondent-facing questions.\n\n### Review and next steps\nPlease review the wording, section flow, eligibility paths, and answer options. I’d be happy to incorporate any changes, such as refining the parent life-stage definitions, adjusting workplace examples, or emphasizing specific policy and manager-practice outcomes before launch.","chat_id":"3d8e21ef-ce02-415d-9269-bef93fb1ce61","guest_id":null,"chat_turn_id":"d2db0e54-e92f-43eb-8b04-8f936a9758b5","chat_name":"Are Workplaces Ready for New Parents?","turn_number":3,"survey_turn_number":1,"questions":[{"id":"preview_question_1","qId":"c2c4b5de-f646-40c0-8539-208496b0320f","text":"Which of these best describes your situation today?","type":"multiple_choice","audio_url":null,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"watch_only":null,"file_type":null,"validation_description":null,"subheading":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"allow_multiple_answers":false,"start_range":null,"end_range":null,"low_rating_label":null,"high_rating_label":null,"options":[{"text":"Not currently working in a paid role","index":0,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"Expecting a child or planning parental leave","index":1,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"Parent of an infant or young child","index":2,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"None of these","index":3,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":true}],"dropdown_options":null,"fields":null,"super_j_question_id":null,"ranking_groups":null,"next":null,"complete":null,"terminate":[0,3],"expectedAnswer":[],"validationQuestion":false,"filterFrom":null,"filterOut":null,"filterFromConfig":null,"filterOutConfig":null,"showIf":null,"showIfElse":null,"showIfLogic":null,"shuffle":null,"break_heading":null,"break_message":null,"breakVariant":null,"progress_percent":null,"keyboardType":null,"flow_key":"PARENT_STATUS","business_role":"screener","route_group":"overall_engagement","analysis_tags":["eligibility_status","parent_status","parent_life_stage","child_age_group","caregiving_role","leave_status","stay_leave_driver","quality_status"],"stimulus_id":null,"cell_id":null,"randomization_group":null,"display_order_group":null,"exposure_acknowledged":null},{"id":"preview_question_2","qId":"c3cbe27a-2552-4221-924b-ac767591cbd8","text":"How do you usually work today?","type":"multiple_choice","audio_url":null,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"watch_only":null,"file_type":null,"validation_description":null,"subheading":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"allow_multiple_answers":false,"start_range":null,"end_range":null,"low_rating_label":null,"high_rating_label":null,"options":[{"text":"Fully remote","index":0,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"Hybrid: remote and office-based","index":1,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"Mainly office-based","index":2,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":null,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null},{"text":"Other arrangement","index":3,"image_url":null,"video_url":null,"type":null,"is_explainable":true,"placeholder":null,"minChar":null,"maxChar":null,"min_selection":null,"max_selection":null,"deselect_all":null}],"dropdown_options":null,"fields":null,"super_j_question_id":null,"ranking_groups":null,"next":null,"complete":null,"terminate":[3],"expectedAnswer":[],"validationQuestion":false,"filterFrom":null,"filterOut":null,"filterFr